        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we offer a variety of employee community service opportunities, and at our U.S.",
        "start_character": 96398,
        "end_character": 96490
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001032208-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001032208-26-000010-d7a04851888a8346",
        "accession_number": "0001032208-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Sharyland Utilities is responsible for providing safe, reliable and efficient transmission and substation services and investing to support infrastructure needs in its service territory, which we discuss below in “Regulation – Utility Regulation – ERCOT Market.” Transmission revenues are provided under tariffs approved by the PUCT.",
        "start_character": 26805,
        "end_character": 27138
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001032208-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001032208-26-000010-d7a04851888a8346",
        "accession_number": "0001032208-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As we discuss in Note 6 of the Notes to Consolidated Financial Statements, in December 2025, we entered into an agreement to sell Ecogas to Gas Natural del Noroeste S.A.",
        "start_character": 47353,
        "end_character": 47522
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001032208-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001032208-26-000010-d7a04851888a8346",
        "accession_number": "0001032208-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In December 2025, we entered into an agreement to sell Ecogas, a natural gas regulated distribution utility that we describe below, to Gas Natural del Noroeste S.A.",
        "start_character": 31335,
        "end_character": 31499
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001032208-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001032208-26-000010-d7a04851888a8346",
        "accession_number": "0001032208-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In September 2025, we entered into an agreement to sell a 45% equity interest in SI Partners to the KKR Partners for $9.99 billion, subject to adjustments.",
        "start_character": 30170,
        "end_character": 30325
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001032208-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001032208-26-000010-d7a04851888a8346",
        "accession_number": "0001032208-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We compete with liquefaction projects currently operating and those under development in the global LNG market.",
        "start_character": 44516,
        "end_character": 44627
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001032208-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001032208-26-000010-d7a04851888a8346",
        "accession_number": "0001032208-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We invest in recruiting, developing and retaining high-performing employees who represent the communities we serve, and we provide a range of programs for employees, including internal and external mentoring and leadership training and workshops, employee resource groups, and a benefits package including wellness benefits and a tuition reimbursement program.",
        "start_character": 95835,
        "end_character": 96195
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001032208-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001032208-26-000010-d7a04851888a8346",
        "accession_number": "0001032208-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "The Cameron LNG Phase 1 facility is located in Hackberry, Louisiana, along the Calcasieu Ship Channel, which handles significant industrial shipping, including large oil and LNG tankers, that we believe is well positioned to supply the Atlantic and Pacific markets.",
        "start_character": 34321,
        "end_character": 34586
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001032208-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001032208-26-000010-d7a04851888a8346",
        "accession_number": "0001032208-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "The ECA LNG Phase 1 project achieved mechanical completion in December 2025, and we expect the project to produce LNG cargoes for sale in the spring of 2026 and sales under the long-term SPAs to begin shortly after substantial completion when the facility commences commercial operations, which is targeted in the summer of 2026.",
        "start_character": 37143,
        "end_character": 37472
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001032208-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001032208-26-000010-d7a04851888a8346",
        "accession_number": "0001032208-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "These responsibilities consist of the construction, maintenance and security of transmission facilities and substations and the monitoring, controlling and dispatching of high-voltage electricity over its transmission facilities in coordination with ERCOT, which we discuss below in “Regulation – Utility Regulation – ERCOT Market.”",
        "start_character": 21803,
        "end_character": 22135
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001032208-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001032208-26-000010-d7a04851888a8346",
        "accession_number": "0001032208-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "We are a holding company whose principal businesses are regulated utilities in California and Texas.",
